//   BOUNDED live view with an honest "(showing N of M points)" caption. The
//   kernel thins the console/bridge block for the live view only (`graph
//   export` keeps every point); the frontend must draw exactly n_shown_points
//   dots and state both counts, and must NOT caption a sub-budget graph.
//   Fixture is authentic backend output (piet_native --do, a 5200-pt scatter).
